    "Google account addresses, separated by commas. SheepTerm opens the link only when signed in as one of them. The file on your Drive is encrypted; without the passphrase it is unreadable." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google account addresses, separated by commas. SheepTerm opens the link only when signed in as one of them. The file on your Drive is encrypted; without the passphrase it is unreadable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google 账户地址，用逗号分隔。仅当登录的账户是其中之一时，SheepTerm 才会打开该链接。您云端硬盘中的文件已加密；没有密码短语将无法读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
