    "macOS 27 hides MAC addresses and the ARP table from commands in a local tab. On: ifconfig, arp, ndp, netstat and networksetup run through launchd and show the real values. Applies to new local tabs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 hides MAC addresses and the ARP table from commands in a local tab. On: ifconfig, arp, ndp, netstat and networksetup run through launchd and show the real values. Applies to new local tabs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 27 会在本地标签页的命令中隐藏 MAC 地址和 ARP 表。开启后：ifconfig、arp、ndp、netstat 和 networksetup 会通过 launchd 运行并显示真实值。适用于新的本地标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
